  "id": "0199897e6530-36d947109609eaad3110f946",
  "section": "Math",
  "domain": "Algebra",
  "related_skills": [
    "Linear equations in one variable",
    "Nonlinear equations in one variable and systems of equations in two variables"
  ],
  "unit": "Unit 7 - More Equation Solving Strategies",
  "description": "Comprehensive lesson covering Unit 7 - More Equation Solving Strategies for SAT Math preparation.",
  "duration": 45,
  "content": "<p>Useful when equations are polynomials or involve unknown coefficients.</p>\n<p><strong>Example 1</strong><br />\nSuppose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></math>.<br />\nExpand LHS: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>.<br />\nMatch coefficients with RHS:<br />\n- <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math><br />\n- <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math><br />\n- <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></math> (checks out)</p>\n<p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math>.</p>\n<hr />\n\n<p>For equations with fractions, multiply both sides by the least common denominator (LCD).</p>\n<p><strong>Example 2</strong><br />\nSolve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></math>.<br />\nLCD = 4. Multiply through:  </p>\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>20</mn><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>17</mn><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>\n\n<p><strong>Example 3</strong><br />\nSolve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>.<br />\nLCD = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>. Multiply through:  </p>\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>\n\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>x</mi><mspace width=\"1em\" /><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\" /><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>\n\n<p>Solve quadratic:  </p>\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#x000B1;</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#x000B1;</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>24</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#x000B1;</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math>\n\n<hr />\n\n<ul>\n<li>Always check for <strong>restrictions</strong> when clearing denominators (denominators <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x02260;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>).  </li>\n<li>Matching coefficients often appears in SAT questions with polynomial identities.  </li>\n<li>After clearing denominators, check for <strong>extraneous solutions</strong> by plugging back.  </li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n\n<p>1) Solve for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math><br />\n2) Solve: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></math><br />\n3) Solve: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math><br />\n4) Solve: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>  </p>\n<hr />\n\n<p>1) Expand LHS: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>. Match with RHS <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math>:<br />\n   - <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math><br />\n   - <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></math><br />\n   - <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math> conflict! → no solution.  </p>\n<p>2) Multiply through by 6: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>&#x021D2;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math>  </p>\n<p>3) LCD = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math><br />\n   Simplify: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math><br />\n   Multiply by 4: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></math><br />\n<br />\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math></p>\n<p>Solve: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#x000B1;</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>96</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#x000B1;</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math><br />\n   → <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"false\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math>  </p>\n<p>4) LCD = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math>: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00028;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#x00029;</mo></mrow></math><br />\n<br />\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></math></p>\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></math>\n<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>\n<p>Solve: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#x000B1;</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#x000B1;</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#x000B1;</mi><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></math><br />\n   → <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#x000B1;</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">\n</code></pre>",
